WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,940
Huzi, when will you learn to cook?

2
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:05,860
It's really fragrant

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,500
Good craftsmanship, better than me

4
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,940
Dad, how can I compare with you?

5
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:15,140
You don't know how to fart when cooking

6
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,340
Last time your mother went back to visit us

7
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,260
I didn't cook melon noodles for you

8
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,380
Who is a real woman eating that stuff?

9
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,020
I'm lame

10
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:20,980
Not a snake kidnapper anymore

11
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,060
If you want to impress, just say it

12
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:25,820
Dad, please ask if the rhubarb outside eats melon noodles and eats your rice.

13
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:29,930
Huzi, are you at home?

14
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:35,480
It's Xiao Ming

15
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,720
I miss you so much

16
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,600
The weather is nice. Let's go take a dip in the river.

17
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,200
You go first. I'll be there in ten minutes. If you need to feed the dog first, I'll go for you.

18
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,360
No, just one serving of dog food

19
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,280
Li Xiaoming, I treated you as my brother in my last life

20
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,040
I didn’t expect you to take me for granted.

21
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:50,480
Okay, don’t you want to find a successor for your sister?

22
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:52,400
I think of someone who will satisfy you both

23
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:03,180
Lao Xu wants a wife but not

24
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,860
As long as you ask, I will bring it to you

25
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:10,230
Careless, your reputation in the village is worse than mine. You are a bachelor yourself.

26
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:12,110
Why are you giving me a wife to tease me?

27
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:14,020
Who is teasing you?

28
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:17,620
How about Li Xiaoyue, one of the three beauties of the forest farm?

29
00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:19,860
Stop blowing your 5006 fiber optic cable farts

30
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:20,940
Li Xiaoyue can like me

31
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:22,780
As long as you do what I say

32
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:24,500
I guarantee you will marry her as your wife

33
00:01:25,140 --> 00:01:26,420
Why don't you do such a good thing yourself?

34
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:27,900
Because there is a wild seed in her belly

35
00:01:28,340 --> 00:01:33,750
I don't think the receiver is a bastard

36
00:01:34,070 --> 00:01:35,230
It's okay, I'm not afraid

37
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:39,160
You're pretty open-minded. I can make her give birth.

38
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:40,440
I think all my efforts have been wasted.

39
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:43,770
You can follow me to the river later and understand.
